    },
    {
      "text": "おこらせて　こんらんさせる。\nいかりで　あいての　こうげきは\nぐーんと　あがってしまう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "상대를 화내게 해서 혼란시킨다.\n분노로 상대의 공격은\n크게 올라가 버린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fait enrager la cible et la plonge dans la\nconfusion, mais augmente fortement son Attaque.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Reizt das Ziel und verursacht Verwirrung.\nDies erhöht jedoch dessen Angriffs-Wert.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un cuaderno en el que se recogen, día a día, los\nprogresos de tu aventura.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa provoca il bersaglio e lo confonde,\nfacendo aumentare però di molto il suo Attacco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user enrages and confuses the\ntarget. However, this also sharply raises\nthe target’s Attack stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "相手を　怒らせて　混乱させる。\n怒りで　相手の　攻撃は\nぐーんと　あがってしまう。",
